{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：11:39 2026-06-27 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今（27日）早上9時54分，葵涌大窩口邨富強樓一名男子從高處墮下，倒臥地面，救護員接報到場，經檢驗後事主已證實當場身亡。 警方經調查後，獲悉死者姓陳（84歲），相信他從上址梯間墮下。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書。死因有待驗屍後確定。</p>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2b9ed4da9f61ab4e1eead17ff9eca2e3/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-27_at_11_27_58_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b5bb421317dce736aa9458ec4295fa0b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-27_at_11_27_57_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子高處墮下倒地氣絕身亡。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2219b1ccaf39fef191e52fbc2ce0b850/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-27_at_11_27_58.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e3d819c81930f34a58648f042ddf9999/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-27_at_11_27_57_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/96baee6eb5484b08c45d7767329d6fe3/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-27_at_11_27_56.jpeg\"/>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-27T04:21:36.146238+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}